---
alwaysApply: true
---
Use bun instead of npm in this project.

Use Tailwind CSS and Daisy UI for the React components in this project.

Use Stately Xstate in this project.

When creating React components use Atomic Design in the following directory structure:

src/components
├── atoms
├── molecules
├── organisms
├── pages
└── templates

Don't forget to check for existing components before creating new ones.

Write and update Storybook stories for each component.

Use Zustand for state and Immer for modifying it.